Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.88,0:00:01.49,Doc,,0,0,0,,Six hundred and twenty per cent.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.54,0:00:05.69,Doc,,0,0,0,,That's how much sales of one Chinese\Nelectric SUV jumped in Australia in a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.74,0:00:09.37,Doc,,0,0,0,,single month of 2026,\Ncompared with the year before.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.42,0:00:13.01,Doc,,0,0,0,,A car most Australians had never heard\Nof two years ago is now inside the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.06,0:00:14.11,Doc,,0,0,0,,national top ten.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.16,0:00:15.45,Doc,,0,0,0,,And it's not alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.50,0:00:19.45,Doc,,0,0,0,,One electric SUV more than doubled\Nits sales and finished most months as
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.50,0:00:21.39,Doc,,0,0,0,,Australia's best-selling EV.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.44,0:00:24.70,Doc,,0,0,0,,One brand you've probably never driven\Ngrew more than one thousand five
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.75,0:00:25.45,Doc,,0,0,0,,hundred per cent.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.50,0:00:28.67,Doc,,0,0,0,,A small Chinese SUV is\Noutselling the Hyundai Kona.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.72,0:00:32.77,Doc,,0,0,0,,And Toyota's most famous ute\Njust roared back to number one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.82,0:00:37.55,Doc,,0,0,0,,2026 has been the most dramatic year\Nfor new cars in Australia in decades.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.60,0:00:39.49,Doc,,0,0,0,,October was the biggest October ever,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.54,0:00:42.53,Doc,,0,0,0,,and the market passed one\Nmillion sales before November.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.58,0:00:45.23,Doc,,0,0,0,,But the winners aren't the cars\Nyou'd have guessed five years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.28,0:00:46.23,Doc,,0,0,0,,So in this video,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.28,0:00:50.47,Doc,,0,0,0,,I'm counting down the ten cars\NAustralians went crazy for in 2026.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.52,0:00:52.49,Doc,,0,0,0,,Real sales numbers, real growth,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.54,0:00:55.85,Doc,,0,0,0,,and the reason each one is winning\Nincluding the one at number one,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.90,0:00:58.47,Doc,,0,0,0,,which changed the Australian\Ncar market forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.52,0:00:59.47,Doc,,0,0,0,,And stay to the end,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.52,0:01:02.66,Doc,,0,0,0,,because I'll tell you what these winners\Nmean for the price of your next car.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.20,0:01:04.99,Doc,,0,0,0,,First, a quick look at the scoreboard,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.04,0:01:07.95,Doc,,0,0,0,,because it explains why this\Nlist looks the way it does.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.00,0:01:13.79,Doc,,0,0,0,,Australians bought 107,493\Nnew vehicles in October 2026,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.84,0:01:15.15,Doc,,0,0,0,,a record for the month.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.20,0:01:18.55,Doc,,0,0,0,,Year to date, the market has\Nalready passed one million sales.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.60,0:01:19.91,Doc,,0,0,0,,But where did the money go?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.96,0:01:24.95,Doc,,0,0,0,,Electric car sales in October were\Nup 237 per cent on October last year,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.00,0:01:28.33,Doc,,0,0,0,,and electric cars took more\Nthan 23 per cent of the market.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.38,0:01:32.81,Doc,,0,0,0,,BYD sold more than ten thousand cars\Nin a single month and is now firmly the
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.86,0:01:36.31,Doc,,0,0,0,,second biggest brand in\NAustralia, behind only Toyota.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.36,0:01:38.85,Doc,,0,0,0,,Cars built in China were up 104 per cent.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.90,0:01:43.36,Doc,,0,0,0,,In the first nine months of the\Nyear, Geely was up 639 per cent.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.41,0:01:46.67,Doc,,0,0,0,,Omoda Jaecoo was up 621 per cent.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.72,0:01:50.67,Doc,,0,0,0,,And Zeekr was up a\Nstaggering 1,560 per cent.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.72,0:01:54.59,Doc,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, plenty of familiar\Nnames went backwards Mitsubishi,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.64,0:02:00.07,Doc,,0,0,0,,Subaru, Nissan, Volkswagen, Hyundai\Nand Mazda all had double-digit falls.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.12,0:02:02.31,Doc,,0,0,0,,So what makes a winner in 2026?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.36,0:02:04.71,Doc,,0,0,0,,Price, technology, and timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.76,0:02:06.99,Doc,,0,0,0,,The winners on this\Nlist are mostly cheaper,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.04,0:02:10.03,Doc,,0,0,0,,newer, and more efficient than the\Ncars they're replacing in buyers'
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.08,0:02:10.67,Doc,,0,0,0,,driveways.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.72,0:02:14.09,Doc,,0,0,0,,But not all of them are Chinese and\Ntwo of the biggest comebacks are from
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.14,0:02:14.97,Doc,,0,0,0,,Toyota.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.02,0:02:16.61,Doc,,0,0,0,,A quick note on the numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.66,0:02:21.45,Doc,,0,0,0,,I'm using official VFACTS figures\Nthrough CarExpert, CarsGuide and GoAuto.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.50,0:02:23.13,Doc,,0,0,0,,Tesla doesn't report to VFACTS,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.18,0:02:25.71,Doc,,0,0,0,,so its figures come from the\NElectric Vehicle Council.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.76,0:02:26.56,Doc,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.17,0:02:30.01,Doc,,0,0,0,,Number ten: the BYD Atto 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.06,0:02:35.52,Doc,,0,0,0,,The Atto 2 is a small SUV, and it's one\Nof BYD's newest models in Australia.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.57,0:02:37.42,Doc,,0,0,0,,And it took off almost straight away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.47,0:02:39.48,Doc,,0,0,0,,In the first half of 2026,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.53,0:02:42.21,Doc,,0,0,0,,the Atto 2 sold 5,401 cars,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.26,0:02:47.18,Doc,,0,0,0,,according to CarExpert putting it in a\Nclose race for BYD's third-best seller.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.23,0:02:48.08,Doc,,0,0,0,,And in October,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.13,0:02:50.72,Doc,,0,0,0,,it was the eighth best-selling\Nvehicle in the entire country,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.77,0:02:53.68,Doc,,0,0,0,,with 1,943 sales.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.73,0:02:56.38,Doc,,0,0,0,,A brand-new nameplate,\Ninside the national top ten.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.43,0:02:58.36,Doc,,0,0,0,,Part of the reason is price.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.41,0:03:05.24,Doc,,0,0,0,,BYD now offers a plug-in hybrid\NAtto 2 DM-i at $25,990 drive-away.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.29,0:03:09.54,Doc,,0,0,0,,That's cheaper than many petrol small\NSUVs, with much lower fuel bills.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.59,0:03:12.06,Doc,,0,0,0,,The Atto 2 shows how BYD wins:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.11,0:03:16.22,Doc,,0,0,0,,not with one hero car, but with a whole\Nwall of models at every price point.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.27,0:03:17.98,Doc,,0,0,0,,If buyers don't want the Atto 2,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.03,0:03:21.78,Doc,,0,0,0,,there's the Atto 1 for $19,990 drive-away,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.83,0:03:24.80,Doc,,0,0,0,,or the Sealion 5, 6, 7 or 8.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.85,0:03:28.57,Doc,,0,0,0,,And that's exactly why BYD has become\Nthe number two brand in Australia.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.31,0:03:32.52,Doc,,0,0,0,,Number nine: the GWM Haval Jolion.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.57,0:03:35.42,Doc,,0,0,0,,While other brands struggled,\Nthe Jolion just kept growing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.47,0:03:37.70,Doc,,0,0,0,,In the first nine months of 2026,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.75,0:03:41.30,Doc,,0,0,0,,it sold 17,051 cars, up 20 per cent,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.35,0:03:44.56,Doc,,0,0,0,,and it finished ninth in the\Nnational year-to-date rankings.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.61,0:03:46.86,Doc,,0,0,0,,That puts it above some very big names.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.91,0:03:48.88,Doc,,0,0,0,,It's ahead of the Mazda CX-5,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.93,0:03:53.28,Doc,,0,0,0,,the Kia Sportage and the Toyota Corolla\NCross in the year-to-date top ten list
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.33,0:03:54.32,Doc,,0,0,0,,none of them made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.37,0:03:55.16,Doc,,0,0,0,,The reason is value.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.21,0:04:01.10,Doc,,0,0,0,,Right now, the Jolion Premium\NHybrid is $32,990 drive-away,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.15,0:04:05.38,Doc,,0,0,0,,with GWM adding a three-thousand-dollar\Ndeposit contribution until the end of
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.43,0:04:06.28,Doc,,0,0,0,,November.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.33,0:04:08.68,Doc,,0,0,0,,That's a lot of small\NSUV, with a hybrid engine,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.73,0:04:11.14,Doc,,0,0,0,,for the price of a basic petrol rival.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.19,0:04:13.24,Doc,,0,0,0,,And the Jolion shows something important:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.29,0:04:15.60,Doc,,0,0,0,,not every Chinese success is electric.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.65,0:04:17.16,Doc,,0,0,0,,Plenty of Australians want a cheap,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.21,0:04:20.80,Doc,,0,0,0,,efficient hybrid that works just like\Ntheir old petrol car and the Jolion
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.85,0:04:22.52,Doc,,0,0,0,,gives them exactly that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.57,0:04:26.93,Doc,,0,0,0,,GWM as a brand has had a tougher few\Nmonths, but the Jolion has been its rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.45,0:04:29.97,Doc,,0,0,0,,Number eight: the Toyota Prado.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.02,0:04:31.49,Doc,,0,0,0,,Here's a comeback story.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.54,0:04:34.53,Doc,,0,0,0,,In early 2026, Prado sales fell hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.58,0:04:37.75,Doc,,0,0,0,,Toyota said that was mainly\Nabout supply, not demand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.80,0:04:41.53,Doc,,0,0,0,,In the first five months of the year,\NPrado sales were down 45 per cent.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.58,0:04:44.55,Doc,,0,0,0,,Then the supply came back\Nand so did the buyers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.60,0:04:46.21,Doc,,0,0,0,,In October 2026,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.26,0:04:48.97,Doc,,0,0,0,,the Prado was the sixth\Nbest-selling vehicle in Australia,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.02,0:04:54.85,Doc,,0,0,0,,with 2,397 sales, up 64 per cent\Non the same month last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.90,0:04:55.95,Doc,,0,0,0,,By the end of October,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.00,0:04:58.61,Doc,,0,0,0,,the Prado had moved ahead of\Nthe Ford Everest for the year,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.66,0:05:04.77,Doc,,0,0,0,,with 18,062 sales against\Nthe Everest's 17,944.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.82,0:05:08.13,Doc,,0,0,0,,That matters, because the Everest\Nhas been the Prado's biggest rival,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.18,0:05:10.97,Doc,,0,0,0,,and for a while it looked like\NFord was winning that fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.02,0:05:12.61,Doc,,0,0,0,,The new Prado is bigger,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.66,0:05:14.59,Doc,,0,0,0,,tougher and more modern than the old one,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.64,0:05:18.05,Doc,,0,0,0,,and Australians clearly still want a\Nproper LandCruiser-badged four-by-four
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.10,0:05:19.51,Doc,,0,0,0,,for towing and touring.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.56,0:05:22.05,Doc,,0,0,0,,It's proof that even in the\Nmiddle of the Chinese boom,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.10,0:05:25.22,Doc,,0,0,0,,a strong nameplate with the\Nright product can still win.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.85,0:05:29.10,Doc,,0,0,0,,Number seven: the Chery Tiggo 4.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.15,0:05:32.24,Doc,,0,0,0,,Two years ago, most Australians\Nhad never heard of Chery.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.29,0:05:37.10,Doc,,0,0,0,,In 2026, its little Tiggo 4 is one of\Nthe most popular cars in the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.15,0:05:38.92,Doc,,0,0,0,,In the first nine months of the year,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.97,0:05:43.87,Doc,,0,0,0,,the Tiggo 4 sold 19,865\Ncars, up 43 per cent.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.92,0:05:47.22,Doc,,0,0,0,,That's sixth in the whole country\Nand ahead of the Hyundai Kona,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.27,0:05:50.04,Doc,,0,0,0,,which sold 18,533.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.09,0:05:51.52,Doc,,0,0,0,,In the first half of the year,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.57,0:05:54.12,Doc,,0,0,0,,it was ahead of both the\NKona and the Haval Jolion.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.17,0:05:55.04,Doc,,0,0,0,,The reason is price.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.09,0:06:01.08,Doc,,0,0,0,,Right now, the Tiggo 4\NUrban is $23,990 drive-away,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.13,0:06:05.86,Doc,,0,0,0,,with a $1,500 fuel card, according\Nto the deals tracker CarSorted.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.91,0:06:09.62,Doc,,0,0,0,,That's thousands of dollars less than\Nmost of the small SUVs it's beating.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.67,0:06:11.50,Doc,,0,0,0,,And Chery as a brand is flying.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.55,0:06:13.01,Doc,,0,0,0,,In the first half of 2026,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.06,0:06:17.64,Doc,,0,0,0,,Chery's sales were up 77 per cent,\Nand almost every model it sells grew.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.69,0:06:22.04,Doc,,0,0,0,,In October, the Tiggo 4 was again\Ninside the national top ten,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.09,0:06:24.65,Doc,,0,0,0,,with 2,178 sales.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.55,0:06:27.75,Doc,,0,0,0,,Number six: the Jaecoo J5.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.80,0:06:30.92,Doc,,0,0,0,,Jaecoo is a sister brand\Nto Chery and Omoda,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.97,0:06:34.18,Doc,,0,0,0,,and it's barely been in Australia long\Nenough for most people to learn how to
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.23,0:06:34.98,Doc,,0,0,0,,say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.03,0:06:38.48,Doc,,0,0,0,,But its J5 small SUV has\Ngone off like a rocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.53,0:06:40.40,Doc,,0,0,0,,According to ACM's motoring team,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.45,0:06:45.22,Doc,,0,0,0,,the J5 sold more than eleven thousand\Ncars in the first nine months of 2026.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.27,0:06:50.34,Doc,,0,0,0,,And the Omoda Jaecoo group was up 621\Nper cent for the year to September.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.39,0:06:51.04,Doc,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.09,0:06:52.08,Doc,,0,0,0,,Price and style.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.13,0:06:57.00,Doc,,0,0,0,,The J5 petrol launched\Nat $25,990 drive-away,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.05,0:07:02.76,Doc,,0,0,0,,and the electric J5 EV was\Npriced at $36,990 drive-away.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.81,0:07:03.64,Doc,,0,0,0,,It has a boxy,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.69,0:07:07.16,Doc,,0,0,0,,upmarket look that some people say\Nreminds them of a much more expensive
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.21,0:07:08.90,Doc,,0,0,0,,European SUV.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.95,0:07:12.68,Doc,,0,0,0,,The J5 EV had more than four thousand\Norders within months of launch,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.73,0:07:13.84,Doc,,0,0,0,,according to The Beep.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.89,0:07:17.30,Doc,,0,0,0,,The J5 shows how fast a new\Nbrand can grow in Australia now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.35,0:07:21.44,Doc,,0,0,0,,A few years ago, a new brand would have\Ntaken a decade to build a following.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.49,0:07:23.43,Doc,,0,0,0,,Jaecoo did it in about a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.95,0:07:26.29,Doc,,0,0,0,,Number five: the Zeekr 7X.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.34,0:07:29.38,Doc,,0,0,0,,Zeekr is Geely's premium electric brand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.43,0:07:31.72,Doc,,0,0,0,,It's competing against Tesla, BMW,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.77,0:07:35.56,Doc,,0,0,0,,Mercedes and Audi and in 2026,\Nit's beating a lot of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.61,0:07:37.24,Doc,,0,0,0,,In the first nine months of the year,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.29,0:07:43.34,Doc,,0,0,0,,Zeekr's sales were up 1,560\Nper cent to 12,120 cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.39,0:07:49.44,Doc,,0,0,0,,In October alone, Zeekr sold\N1,874 cars, up 767 per cent.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.49,0:07:54.18,Doc,,0,0,0,,And the star is the Zeekr\N7X, a mid-size electric SUV.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.23,0:07:57.74,Doc,,0,0,0,,The Driven reported in May that it had\Nbecome Australia's best-selling premium
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.79,0:08:01.92,Doc,,0,0,0,,SUV, and in July it cracked the\Nnational top ten for the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.97,0:08:03.90,Doc,,0,0,0,,Think about how remarkable that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.95,0:08:05.30,Doc,,0,0,0,,A premium electric SUV,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.35,0:08:08.24,Doc,,0,0,0,,from a brand that only\Nlaunched in Australia recently,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.29,0:08:10.68,Doc,,0,0,0,,outselling famous European luxury names.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.73,0:08:13.48,Doc,,0,0,0,,The 7X wins on technology and value:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.53,0:08:16.10,Doc,,0,0,0,,long range, fast charging,\Na luxurious cabin,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.15,0:08:19.28,Doc,,0,0,0,,and a price that undercuts\Nmany European rivals.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.33,0:08:22.64,Doc,,0,0,0,,And while the brands that were here first\Nhave been cutting prices to keep up,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.69,0:08:24.54,Doc,,0,0,0,,Zeekr has been taking orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.59,0:08:27.84,Doc,,0,0,0,,If you want to know where the luxury\Ncar market in Australia is heading,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.89,0:08:28.85,Doc,,0,0,0,,look at this car.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.58,0:08:32.35,Doc,,0,0,0,,Number four: the Toyota HiLux.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.40,0:08:34.55,Doc,,0,0,0,,Australia's favourite ute is back on top.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.60,0:08:36.21,Doc,,0,0,0,,In October 2026,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.26,0:08:38.77,Doc,,0,0,0,,the HiLux was the best-selling\Nvehicle in the whole country,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.82,0:08:44.65,Doc,,0,0,0,,with 5,954 sales, up 34 per cent\Non the same month last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.70,0:08:47.59,Doc,,0,0,0,,It beat the Ford Ranger by\Nmore than a thousand units.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.64,0:08:50.35,Doc,,0,0,0,,That's a big deal, because\Nit had been a tough year.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.40,0:08:52.73,Doc,,0,0,0,,The Ranger led the\Nmarket for most of 2026,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.78,0:08:56.81,Doc,,0,0,0,,and in the first nine months, HiLux\Nsales were down about ten per cent.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.86,0:08:59.37,Doc,,0,0,0,,The new-generation HiLux\Narrived during the year,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.42,0:09:00.83,Doc,,0,0,0,,and buyers were waiting for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.88,0:09:03.35,Doc,,0,0,0,,And Toyota is fighting harder than usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.40,0:09:07.91,Doc,,0,0,0,,It's offering a four-thousand-dollar\Nfinance deposit bonus on the HiLux SR5 a
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.96,0:09:09.39,Doc,,0,0,0,,rare move for Toyota.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.44,0:09:12.17,Doc,,0,0,0,,The new range also includes\Nan electric version.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.22,0:09:14.67,Doc,,0,0,0,,Now, the HiLux isn't growing\Nthe way the Chinese brands are.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.72,0:09:17.69,Doc,,0,0,0,,But it shows that the old\Nchampions aren't finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.74,0:09:20.63,Doc,,0,0,0,,When Toyota gets the product\Nand the supply right,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.68,0:09:21.89,Doc,,0,0,0,,Australians still line up for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.94,0:09:25.59,Doc,,0,0,0,,And the battle between the HiLux and\Nthe Ranger for the number one spot in
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.64,0:09:28.44,Doc,,0,0,0,,2026 is going right down to the wire.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.22,0:09:31.51,Doc,,0,0,0,,Number three: the Geely EX5.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.56,0:09:34.05,Doc,,0,0,0,,This is the car from\Nthe start of the video.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.10,0:09:36.03,Doc,,0,0,0,,In September 2026,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.08,0:09:40.45,Doc,,0,0,0,,Geely EX5 sales were up 620 per\Ncent on September last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.50,0:09:44.87,Doc,,0,0,0,,In July, it was up 315 per cent\Nand ninth in the national rankings.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.92,0:09:45.77,Doc,,0,0,0,,And in October,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.82,0:09:47.95,Doc,,0,0,0,,it was the tenth best-selling\Nvehicle in the country,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.00,0:09:52.85,Doc,,0,0,0,,with 1,789 sales, up\Nmore than 420 per cent.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.90,0:09:58.25,Doc,,0,0,0,,Geely as a brand sold 23,632 cars in\Nthe first nine months of the year,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.30,0:10:00.21,Doc,,0,0,0,,up 639 per cent.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.26,0:10:05.67,Doc,,0,0,0,,In October alone, it sold\N4,365, up 520 per cent.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.72,0:10:10.26,Doc,,0,0,0,,In May, GoAuto reported that Geely had\Npassed ten thousand sales in Australia.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.31,0:10:13.19,Doc,,0,0,0,,The EX5 is a mid-size electric SUV,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.24,0:10:17.79,Doc,,0,0,0,,priced at $41,990 before on-road costs,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.84,0:10:21.27,Doc,,0,0,0,,and right now Geely is offering\Nnovated lease discounts on top.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.32,0:10:24.87,Doc,,0,0,0,,That makes it one of the cheapest\Nmid-size electric SUVs you can buy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.92,0:10:26.57,Doc,,0,0,0,,Geely isn't a small company, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.62,0:10:28.65,Doc,,0,0,0,,It owns Volvo and Zeekr,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.70,0:10:30.57,Doc,,0,0,0,,it controls Polestar and Lotus,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.62,0:10:34.11,Doc,,0,0,0,,and its founder is one of the biggest\Nshareholders in Mercedes-Benz.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.16,0:10:38.23,Doc,,0,0,0,,So the EX5 isn't a cheap gamble from an\Nunknown brand it's one of the biggest
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.28,0:10:41.58,Doc,,0,0,0,,car groups in the world finally\Ngetting serious about Australia.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.23,0:10:45.54,Doc,,0,0,0,,Number two: the BYD Sealion 7.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.59,0:10:48.84,Doc,,0,0,0,,The Sealion 7 is a mid-size electric SUV,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.89,0:10:51.70,Doc,,0,0,0,,and it's become one of the most\Nimportant cars in Australia.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.75,0:10:54.08,Doc,,0,0,0,,In the first nine months of 2026,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.13,0:10:58.86,Doc,,0,0,0,,it sold 19,964 cars, up 135 per cent,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.91,0:11:03.00,Doc,,0,0,0,,and finished fifth in the whole\Ncountry above the Isuzu D-Max,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.05,0:11:05.14,Doc,,0,0,0,,the Hyundai Kona and the Ford Everest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.19,0:11:06.53,Doc,,0,0,0,,In the first half of the year,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.58,0:11:12.94,Doc,,0,0,0,,it was BYD's best-selling model,\Nwith 12,516 sales, up 233 per cent.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.99,0:11:18.10,Doc,,0,0,0,,And in October, it was fifth\Nagain, with 2,524 sales.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.15,0:11:22.70,Doc,,0,0,0,,The Sealion 7 gives buyers a big electric\NSUV with a lot of technology at a
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.75,0:11:25.58,Doc,,0,0,0,,price that undercuts many\Nrivals and right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.63,0:11:28.18,Doc,,0,0,0,,BYD is adding four\Nthousand dollars cashback,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.23,0:11:33.68,Doc,,0,0,0,,bringing the Sealion 7 Premium\Nto $50,990 before on-road costs.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.73,0:11:37.80,Doc,,0,0,0,,And it carried BYD to a place no\NChinese brand had been before.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.85,0:11:41.72,Doc,,0,0,0,,BYD finished second in the national\Nbrand rankings every month from April to
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.77,0:11:42.60,Doc,,0,0,0,,October.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.65,0:11:47.78,Doc,,0,0,0,,In October, it sold 10,025\Ncars, up 153 per cent.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.83,0:11:50.85,Doc,,0,0,0,,The Sealion 7 is the car\Nthat made that possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.69,0:11:53.88,Doc,,0,0,0,,And number one: the Tesla Model Y.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.93,0:11:56.48,Doc,,0,0,0,,In the first nine months of 2026,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.53,0:12:01.06,Doc,,0,0,0,,Tesla delivered 35,930\NModel Ys in Australia,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.11,0:12:03.12,Doc,,0,0,0,,according to the Electric Vehicle Council.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.17,0:12:04.78,Doc,,0,0,0,,That's up 108 per cent.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.83,0:12:08.82,Doc,,0,0,0,,It finished third in the country just\Nbehind the Ford Ranger and the Toyota
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.87,0:12:11.62,Doc,,0,0,0,,HiLux, and ahead of the Toyota RAV4.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.67,0:12:12.60,Doc,,0,0,0,,Think about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.65,0:12:16.66,Doc,,0,0,0,,An electric car is now outselling\Nthe RAV4 for the year in Australia.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.71,0:12:19.18,Doc,,0,0,0,,And in May and June,\Naccording to CarExpert,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.23,0:12:22.98,Doc,,0,0,0,,the Model Y was the best-selling new\Nvehicle in the entire country ahead of
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.03,0:12:24.08,Doc,,0,0,0,,every ute.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.13,0:12:27.76,Doc,,0,0,0,,In October, the Model Y sold 3,105,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.81,0:12:32.66,Doc,,0,0,0,,up 322 per cent, and it was the fourth\Nbest-selling vehicle in Australia.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.71,0:12:34.10,Doc,,0,0,0,,It hasn't been perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.15,0:12:36.06,Doc,,0,0,0,,Tesla has been cutting prices on stock,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.11,0:12:39.24,Doc,,0,0,0,,and Tesla as a brand had a\Nquieter October than September.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.29,0:12:42.68,Doc,,0,0,0,,But the Model Y is the reason\Nelectric cars stopped being a niche in
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.73,0:12:43.62,Doc,,0,0,0,,Australia.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.67,0:12:46.42,Doc,,0,0,0,,When an EV sits on the\Nnational podium for the year,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.47,0:12:48.16,Doc,,0,0,0,,the market has changed for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.21,0:12:50.33,Doc,,0,0,0,,That's why the Model Y is number one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.10,0:12:52.13,Doc,,0,0,0,,Before the wrap-up,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.18,0:12:54.97,Doc,,0,0,0,,some honourable mentions cars\Nthat just missed the top ten,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.02,0:12:57.33,Doc,,0,0,0,,but had a brilliant 2026.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.38,0:12:58.11,Doc,,0,0,0,,The Ford Ranger.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.16,0:13:02.67,Doc,,0,0,0,,It's not growing sales were down about\Nten per cent in the first nine months
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.72,0:13:05.77,Doc,,0,0,0,,but with 37,858 sales,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.82,0:13:09.23,Doc,,0,0,0,,it was still the best-selling vehicle\Nin Australia for the year to September.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.28,0:13:12.99,Doc,,0,0,0,,In a year of upheaval, staying\Nnumber one is a success of its own.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.04,0:13:15.55,Doc,,0,0,0,,The new-generation Toyota RAV4.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.60,0:13:17.91,Doc,,0,0,0,,It had a slow start while\Nthe old model ran out,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.96,0:13:20.81,Doc,,0,0,0,,but by September it was back\Nto second in the country,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.86,0:13:24.37,Doc,,0,0,0,,with 4,624 sales, up 81 per cent.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.42,0:13:29.85,Doc,,0,0,0,,In July, around four in ten RAV4s sold\Nwere plug-in hybrids a big change for
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.90,0:13:31.65,Doc,,0,0,0,,Australia's favourite SUV.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.70,0:13:33.79,Doc,,0,0,0,,The BYD Shark 6.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.84,0:13:36.71,Doc,,0,0,0,,Australia's first plug-in hybrid\Nute to really break through.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.76,0:13:41.39,Doc,,0,0,0,,In October, it sold 1,843, up 72 per cent,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.44,0:13:45.49,Doc,,0,0,0,,and finished ninth in the country ahead\Nof the Isuzu D-Max and the Mitsubishi
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.54,0:13:46.63,Doc,,0,0,0,,Triton for the month.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.68,0:13:48.11,Doc,,0,0,0,,The Chery Tiggo 7.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.16,0:13:54.72,Doc,,0,0,0,,In the first half of 2026, its sales\Nwere up 173 per cent, to 5,589.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.77,0:13:58.48,Doc,,0,0,0,,Chery's bigger SUV is following\Nthe Tiggo 4's success.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.53,0:13:59.57,Doc,,0,0,0,,The Hyundai Kona.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.62,0:14:01.57,Doc,,0,0,0,,In a terrible year for Hyundai,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.62,0:14:04.57,Doc,,0,0,0,,with the brand down almost\N29 per cent in October,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.62,0:14:10.43,Doc,,0,0,0,,the Kona went up 9 per cent in the\Nfirst nine months, with 18,533 sales.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.48,0:14:12.77,Doc,,0,0,0,,It's proof that the\Nright car can still win,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.82,0:14:14.03,Doc,,0,0,0,,even when the brand is struggling.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.08,0:14:19.99,Doc,,0,0,0,,And GAC a Chinese brand that only arrived\Nrecently and had already sold 3,175
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.04,0:14:22.35,Doc,,0,0,0,,cars by the end of September.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.40,0:14:25.52,Doc,,0,0,0,,Just one more sign of how fast\Nnew brands are growing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.24,0:14:28.34,Doc,,0,0,0,,So what do these ten\Nwinners have in common?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.39,0:14:29.99,Doc,,0,0,0,,First, value.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.04,0:14:33.27,Doc,,0,0,0,,Almost every car on this list\Ngives buyers more technology,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.32,0:14:37.67,Doc,,0,0,0,,more efficiency or more equipment for\Nless money than the car it's replacing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.72,0:14:39.55,Doc,,0,0,0,,Second, choice of power.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.60,0:14:43.41,Doc,,0,0,0,,Hybrids, plug-in hybrids and\Nelectric cars are all on this list.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.46,0:14:46.89,Doc,,0,0,0,,Australians didn't all switch to EVs\Nthey switched to whatever saves them
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.94,0:14:47.73,Doc,,0,0,0,,money.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.78,0:14:50.25,Doc,,0,0,0,,Third, the old champions\Ncan still fight back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.30,0:14:54.17,Doc,,0,0,0,,The HiLux and the Prado prove that when\NToyota gets supply and product right,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.22,0:14:55.14,Doc,,0,0,0,,buyers return.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.19,0:14:56.75,Doc,,0,0,0,,And what does this mean for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.80,0:14:59.89,Doc,,0,0,0,,Competition is the best thing\Nthat can happen to car buyers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.94,0:15:02.79,Doc,,0,0,0,,The success of these cars is the reason\Nwe're seeing four-thousand-dollar
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.84,0:15:04.61,Doc,,0,0,0,,cashbacks, fuel cards,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.66,0:15:07.47,Doc,,0,0,0,,and a new car for under twenty\Nthousand dollars drive-away.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.52,0:15:09.67,Doc,,0,0,0,,If you're buying, shop across brands,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.72,0:15:11.19,Doc,,0,0,0,,compare the drive-away price,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.24,0:15:14.55,Doc,,0,0,0,,and don't assume the badge you've\Nalways bought is the best value anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.60,0:15:17.59,Doc,,0,0,0,,So that's the list: the BYD Atto 2,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.64,0:15:19.89,Doc,,0,0,0,,the Haval Jolion, the Toyota Prado,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.94,0:15:22.59,Doc,,0,0,0,,the Chery Tiggo 4, the Jaecoo J5,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.64,0:15:26.55,Doc,,0,0,0,,the Zeekr 7X, the Toyota\NHiLux, the Geely EX5,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.60,0:15:30.53,Doc,,0,0,0,,the BYD Sealion 7 and at\Nnumber one, the Tesla Model Y.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.58,0:15:33.69,Doc,,0,0,0,,Now tell me in the comments: which\Nof these would you actually buy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.74,0:15:37.51,Doc,,0,0,0,,And which car do you think will\Nbe the surprise hit of 2027?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.56,0:15:38.61,Doc,,0,0,0,,If you enjoyed this,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.66,0:15:40.89,Doc,,0,0,0,,hit like and subscribe\Nand if you missed it,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.94,0:15:44.87,Doc,,0,0,0,,check out my video on the ten\Nbiggest car disasters of 2026.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.92,0:15:46.08,Doc,,0,0,0,,See you in the next one.
